      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "That's really cool, I'm jealous of your students! For the time being, you might be able to use a VRC_SyncVideoStream setup with a private YouTube stream to achieve something similar, though it'd only really work when doing lessons live.",
      "viewerReactions": null
