      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{59b80cbbd1662e660835c7c5|full_name}:  Thanks, Checking the specs \"Play, PlayIndex, Stop, Pause, Next, Previous, Shuffle, Clear, AddURL\"  seems like there's interesting options.  In the near term, I'm fine - especially as I place and upload 3D work from students anyway. The Web Panel is more about making VRChat useful to non-Unity using teachers (at places like Teacherspayteachers.com)   Below is the art work based off the sketches. Curiously the class is actually sets up students to create educational content for VRChat....",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
