      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I had a similar setup for Endgame, with a form that people could upload image URLs to a database of slideshows, and then whichever slideshow was active could be viewed in VRChat, with a remote control to go to the next and previous image URL's. It worked really nicely for those of us who want alternative uses for VRChat in addition to streaming or hanging out. With the right tools, VRChat can be a great educational platform as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
