      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 4
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I feel you on this one. I've been updating Virtual Week-ality every week for one year straight, and I got sick of re-uploading the same world over and over again. I was about to switch to web panels, even made a little site I've been working on during the past couple of months, so, needless to say, I was extremely frustrated when they removed the panels.\n\nThanks for using VRChat for educational purposes, by the way. I really want to encourage everyone to make the use of social platforms more common... assuming we're gonna get our web panels back at some point.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
