      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{59c0e5cd39a9874475bcbfd7|full_name}: I'm currently playing with VRC_Panorama to fetch images, and the only real weaknesses: (1) the way it swaps the material is inflexible (a render texture would be easier to use for me);  (2) the number of images has to be known in advance; (3) you still have to make a server-side thing to actually do the redirection.\n\nI'd really kill for a way to provide a URL to a JSON file full of URLs. Same with video player, actually. I should check that there's a feature request for that too. :(",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
